WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Working a case.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.902
Work arrives as a queue your whole section can see.

3
00:00:08.352 --> 00:00:12.468
Claim a case, and it’s on your list at once.

4
00:00:12.468 --> 00:00:14.415
Claiming isn’t credit.

5
00:00:14.415 --> 00:00:15.862
The work is.

6
00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:19.291
The procedure shows the next step,

7
00:00:19.291 --> 00:00:23.683
and the form asks only for what that step needs.

8
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.832
Record what you found,

9
00:00:25.832 --> 00:00:29.991
and Vantage calculates the candidate, citing every input.

10
00:00:30.641 --> 00:00:32.656
Decide, with your reason.

11
00:00:32.656 --> 00:00:37.743
A step that needs evidence first says so, before it refuses.

12
00:00:38.393 --> 00:00:41.812
Every entry is signed into the history.

13
00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:47.008
Hand it on, and each of you keeps exactly what you did.
